# ==========================================================================
# Web Guardian - root .gitignore
#
# Keeps tokens, keys, credentials and local environment files out of the
# repository. Any value the Cloud_Runner needs is supplied only as a GitHub
# Actions encrypted secret, never a committed file.
#
# Generated output is ignored too: dist/ (compiled build), artifacts/ (raw
# run output, published to the runs-data branch instead), _site/ (CI Pages
# staging), test-results/ and checkpoints/.
# ==========================================================================

# --- Secrets / credentials / environment -----------------------------------
# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env

# Generic secret / credential bundles
*.secret
secrets.*
*.secrets
credentials
credentials.*
*.credentials
auth.json

# Keys and certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cert
*.crt
*.der
*.keystore
*.jks
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*

# Cloud / tool credential caches commonly found in a working tree
.npmrc
.netrc
.aws/
.gcloud/
*.gpg
*.asc

# --- Dependencies ----------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/

# --- Logs & local scratch output ------------------------------------------
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
# Stray local scratch logs/notes seen in the working tree
_*.log
_*.txt

# --- Generated publish bundle ----------------------------------------------
# The local published Pages bundle is build output assembled from
# artifacts/runs + dashboard/ + the replay office build. It is generated on
# every successful local run and must never be committed. Staging/backup
# siblings created during the atomic swap are also transient.
# NOTE: this narrowly ignores ONLY the generated bundle under artifacts/, not
# artifacts/ as a whole (raw runs are handled by the runs-data branch work).
artifacts/published/
artifacts/published.staging/
artifacts/published.prev-*/
# CI Pages staging dir (assembled in the workflow, never committed)
_site/

# --- Test / tooling runtime noise ------------------------------------------
test-results/
.playwright/
playwright/.cache/
.vitest/
coverage/

# --- Editor / OS files -----------------------------------------------------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
*.local

# --- Generated build + raw run artifacts (kept OFF main) -------------------
# Raw per-run artifacts are published to the runs-data branch by CI and the
# Pages site; they are large (hundreds of MB) and regenerated each run, so
# they are NOT committed to main. dist/ is compiled build output
# (reproducible via 'npm run build').
dist/
artifacts/

# --- Local source snapshots (kept OFF main) --------------------------------
checkpoints/
